<section class="funded-section">
  <div class="section-header">
    <p class="section-label">
      FUNDED RESEARCH
    </p>

    <h2>
      Sponsored Research Projects
    </h2>

    <p class="section-description">
      Floater Dynamics Laboratory has conducted research projects
      supported by government agencies, national laboratories,
      and offshore industries in the fields of offshore floating systems,
      marine renewable energy, hydrodynamics, and coupled dynamics.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="research-group">
    <h3>
      Principal Investigator
    </h3>

